  dream_20260513T092135:
    dream_id: dream_20260513T092135
    project: structfuse-context
    status: reviewing
    review_mode: full
    review_visible: true
    writing_visible: true
    venue: EMNLP 2026 Findings
    focus: 'Route A reframe：从正向方法贡献转为分析论文 "When Does Cross-Method Consensus Fail in
      Circuit Discovery?"


      关键变化：

      1. 叙事完全反转——CSS 失败是主要发现，IOI 成功是例外

      2. 三个核心贡献：(a) ACDC binarization pathology + top-k fix, (b) component-level scoring
      scaling failure on Qwen, (c) diagnostic guidelines (Jaccard check, granularity
      check)

      3. 明确承认 CSS = feature selection stability index (Nogueira & Brown 2016)，novelty
      在 domain-specific failure mode characterization

      4. 目标 Findings track，不是 Main

      5. 实际数据：IOI PASS(1), Arithmetic FAIL(1), SVA inconclusive(1), Qwen IFR FAIL(1),
      Qwen ACDC FAIL(1), Factual Recall running(1), size-controlled baseline running(1)


      审稿人请重点评估：(1) 负面发现+失败模式分析是否足够 Findings track, (2) 现有实验覆盖度是否充分, (3) 12 天内能否补齐缺失实验（CIs,
      size-controlled baseline, ablation comparison）'
